    "title": "Prototype connection drags cannot reach frames outside the view",
    "url": "https://github.com/storytold/figcraft/issues/new?title=Prototype%20connection%20drags%20cannot%20reach%20frames%20outside%20the%20view&body=When%20authoring%20a%20prototype%20connection%2C%20holding%20its%20plus-handle%20drag%20near%20the%20canvas%20edge%20does%20not%20pan%20the%20editor.%20A%20frame%20outside%20the%20view%20cannot%20be%20reached%20without%20abandoning%20the%20drag.%0A%0AReproduction%20on%20baseline%20%608eb0b87646c5%60%3A%20create%20two%20200x150%20frames%20at%20x%3D0%20and%20x%3D1100%2C%20select%20the%20first%2C%20open%20Prototype%2C%20drag%20its%20connection%20handle%20to%20the%20right%20edge%20and%20hold.%20The%20view%20stays%20at%20x%3D100%20and%20no%20connection%20to%20the%20target%20is%20created.%0A%0AExpected%3A%20pan%20during%20the%20authoring%20drag%2C%20keep%20the%20source%20anchor%20correct%2C%20and%20allow%20a%20drop%20on%20the%20target.%20A%20reviewed%20local%20implementation%20does%20this%20and%20creates%20a%20navigation%20interaction.%0A%0A%21%5BBefore%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fraw.githubusercontent.com%2FStrajnarFilip%2Ffigcraft%2F7d2234f016bf67315da33a8c9fa8d8416a1e646e%2Fscreenshots%2Ffigcraft-2015-before.png%29%0A%0A%21%5BAfter%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fraw.githubusercontent.com%2FStrajnarFilip%2Ffigcraft%2F7d2234f016bf67315da33a8c9fa8d8416a1e646e%2Fscreenshots%2Ffigcraft-2015-after.png%29%0A%0ARelated%20%232015%20describes%20clicking%20existing%20links.%20This%20report%20isolates%20the%20separate%20authoring-drag%20workflow.%20Original%20synthetic%20FigCraft%20captures%3B%20%5Bprovenance%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fraw.githubusercontent.com%2FStrajnarFilip%2Ffigcraft%2F7d2234f016bf67315da33a8c9fa8d8416a1e646e%2Fprovenance.json%29.%0A",
